{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t運輸署公布，今早8時20分，接獲營運商報告咪錶泊車系統出現故障，現正緊急搶修。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n署方已責成營運商從速跟進修復工作，將對駕駛人士的影響減至最低，並徹查事故原因及提交報告。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n署方說，如有查詢，駕駛人士可致電服務熱線2332 3700。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:22:02.019218+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:06:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T05:39:18.515334+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:19:12.180986+00:00","content_hash":"9c58a222bd2ac8a74b0a6a11069bd0f8803daf975aa1540dd70a7a181edfca2a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}